1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,307
Sodium carbonate is a special case worth knowing.

2
00:00:03,307 --> 00:00:07,838
It is neutralised in two stages, so its curve has two steps.

3
00:00:07,838 --> 00:00:14,648
First, carbonate takes one proton and becomes bicarbonate, near pH eight point three.

4
00:00:14,648 --> 00:00:17,239
Phenolphthalein turns colourless here.

